  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Speech-MASSIVE",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSpeech-MASSIVE\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nSpeech-MASSIVE is a multilingual Spoken Language Understanding (SLU) dataset comprising the speech counterpart for a portion of the MASSIVE textual corpus. Speech-MASSIVE covers 12 languages (Arabic, German, Spanish, French, Hungarian, Korean, Dutch, Polish, European Portuguese, Russian, Turkish, and Vietnamese) from different families and inherits from MASSIVE the annotations for the intent prediction and slot-filling tasks. MASSIVE\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/FBK-MT/Speech-MASSIVE.",
  "alternateName": [
    "FBK-MT/Speech-MASSIVE",
    "A Multilingual Speech Dataset for SLU and Beyond"
  ],
